Z||000012||mrfixit58||07-12-2000||08:44 PM||||Hey guys,<P>Thanks for the nice comments about my car. Even though the pictures were taken with 2000 miles of road crud and brake dust (the carrier smelled like he came all the way from California with the emergency brake "on").<P>Someone started a thread asking owners if they have a name for their car. I mentioned tto my wife about a name and she suggested "Bluebell". I think it'll stick. The previous owners, both sisters, last name was Blue. The name just seems right. Someone also asked about interior picks so I attached a couple. I have most of the stuff needed to make he prance again but, may be in contact for some minor stuff (thanks fieroshop).<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87GT_LI.jpg"> <BR>Note the special pine tree air freashener. This baby has GOT to be faster.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87GT_RI.jpg"> <P>The dash mat has reserved the dash. it's perfect. A little soap, glue and attention and I hope to have her sparkling.<P>Thanks again,<BR>Roy<P>||||reg||10
